Extra hosts of the embeds' Content-Security-Policy (default.hbs, posts and pages, setting embed_consent),
only when the owner turned on « Consent tools » (setting consent_tools, off by default) in the fallback
consent mode (setting consent_notice = Notice or Banner): the common audience measurement, tag manager
and advertising services, so that a script the owner gated with data-consent (and whatever it loads) can
run on posts and pages once the reader accepts. Off, the policy is exactly the one of None: such a
script pasted without data-consent stays blocked on posts and pages. Not listed (YouTube, X…): embeds
keep their facade. Another service: see docs/guide-auteur.md (« Brancher un outil… »).
Parameter kind="script" or kind="frame".
--~}}
